omandi, stanno discutendo su dove andare dopo! La colonia delle Ande o Jolly-Jolly?\".","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-10-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/39xqJ7n5gjv4qnLHXwWSTvR3M6W.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/39xqJ7n5gjv4qnLHXwWSTvR3M6W.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96398/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"3269695","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"SIGNORE E SIGNORI","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"\"I nostri due tracciatori sono stati arrestati dall'agenzia di controllo per aver causato un disturbo alla periferia della colonia. Dopo aver ricevuto il chip per evitare la fuga, riceveranno presto una sanzione, ma per ora sono invitati a fare un giro turistico a Jolly-Jolly. Memempu è felice!\".","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-10-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5gZQ3dORQ7JUMXTMK1eTUWnjjoB.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5gZQ3dORQ7JUMXTMK1eTUWnjjoB.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96398/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"3269696","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"NIENTE LAVORO, NIENTE VITA","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"\"Memempu e Gagumber vengono portati nel labirinto \"Kaze no Oka\" (Collina del Vento) da Merooro come punizione. Il luogo, una volta una vasta foresta piena di verde, è diventato un deserto di alberi marci. Merooro, che ha lottato con il tempo estremo nel labirinto negli ultimi anni, chiede loro di effettuare delle \"riparazioni\" per ripristinare la foresta.\"","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/de3pYfyrPnRAKneklSInOfapbg5.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/de3pYfyrPnRAKneklSInOfapbg5.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96398/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"3269697","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Memempu and Gagumber are free once more... until they're caught by the Yuri team, a gang of young miscreants based in the Colony of AreYaar. The kids take them back to their home base and teach them the secret behind the Colony's supposed equality!","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xuQEfgJYVUqtZseS63xsVOaoZY1.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xuQEfgJYVUqtZseS63xsVOaoZY1.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96398/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"3270881","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Memempu, Gagumber, Zackletu, and Yuri have teamed up for their journey, but one night Memempu gets sick and has a terrifying nightmare. After that, the grown-ups just seem to act more and more strangely...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1bKfy3fyNeDEsK2NCUOdnfsKzwf.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1bKfy3fyNeDEsK2NCUOdnfsKzwf.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/96398/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"3270882","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The team visits the Calacalla Colony to get Yuri treatment. During the downtime, Gagumber runs into an old friend, and Memempu tells Zackletu about her dream...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-11-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":5.5,"thumbn